  "[UH-1 IPC p.35] 3-4. FLIGHT TASKS AND SUPPLEMENTAL INFORMATION. TASK: PREPARE DA FORM 7243-R (UH-1 PPC). 1001.09 (ATM - 1004) SUPPLEMENTAL INFORMATION: NOTE: Task 1004 does not contain all the possibilities that exist when preparing performance data. You must understand all of the variables involved in planning. Remember, performance data is only accurate when the exact environmental conditions that were used to compute the data exist at the time the data is needed or used. TASK: PERFORM PREFLIGHT INSPECTION. 1501 (ATM - 1005) SUPPLEMENTAL INFORMATION: CAUTION: Caution should be taken at night while preflighting the aircraft to avoid personal injury. TASK: P",
