  "[UH-1 IPC p.34] CHAPTER 3. TRAINING OBJECTIVES 3- 1. TC 1-211. The Department of the Army Aircrew Training Manual (ATM) for the UH-1 utility helicopter will be used in this course to provide conditions, standards, and descriptions for tasks listed in paragraph 2-3 of this FTG. Flight tasks not in the ATM and flight tasks supplemental information are provided below. 3-2. TASKCONTENTS. a. Each task is identified by a number and a title which correspond to the tasks listed in Chapter 2. b. Conditions. These conditions specify the situation in which the task is to be performed. They describe the important aspects of the performance environment. c. Standards. The",
